        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yeah it's still and it's still heating it's about 68 inside it's just the grinding outside that's freaking me out a little i turned it and back on once yesterday to see if it would stop but it didn't",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Understood, it's still heating and 68 inside, so we'll get it looked at. Let's get the address. What's the street address, and what's the ZIP?",
