        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Let me make sure I have the street right. How do you spell \"Hughes Ton\"? Please go letter by letter.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "sure its h o u s t o n hughes ton like the one in manhattan but we say it house here",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it, Houston Street. Let me check the ZIP and look up the address. You're in our service area. Is this your home, and what's the system's rough age?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yeah its my home it's a ductless heat pump i think about years old",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks. Who's at home with it right now, and has anyone there had a harder time with the cold?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "it's me and my partner at home we're both healthy nobody's trouble with the cold we're just a little annoyed about a noise",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Good to know. Let me look at what's open for a heat pump check. I have openings today from 12 to 4 or 4 to 8, tomorrow morning, afternoon or evening, and Thursday from 12 to 4. Which day and time works for you?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "tomorrow morning works whatever's first in the morning is fine",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Tomorrow morning, 8 to 12, is open. I'll read back the address and number before booking. Let me read that back: your home at 81 Houston Street, Staten Island, 10302, and the best number is 718, 555, 0178. Is that right?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yep that's right",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Before I book, who approves the work, and is there anything the tech should know when they get there, like a gate code, a buzzer or a dog?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "know gate code just ring the bell at the front there's no dog a heats pump is out back they can go around the side of the house me or my will be home two let them in",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it, ring the front bell and go around the side to the heat pump out back. Since you own the home, you're the one approving the work. Booking that now. Can I get a name for the booking?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "paolo russo",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "You're all set for tomorrow, Tuesday, with the technician arriving between 8 and 12. Anything else?",
          "said": null
        },
