      "grader_score": 3,
      "grader_notes": "The pilot-out turn is clunky: it asks who's home with the wife, then immediately jumps to 'Good news' and a window choice, stacking two questions. Earlier, saying the technician will sort out costs in person sits awkwardly against the later correct line that a manager will review coverage, though no refund or free visit was promised and the read-back was handled well.",
      "reply_delay_p50_ms": 419.8157499777153,
