      "duration_ms": 26014.02191701345,
      "transcript": [
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Hi, this is Summit Air. Is this Thomas?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "you were here last week for no heat and it's out again three days of working and now it's out",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sorry you're back in the cold. Is this the same no-heat problem from last week, at 800 Springfield Boulevard?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yeah that's the address eight oh oh springfield blvd queens one one three six eight um it's the same problem the heat worked for about three days after your guys came out and then it quit again this morning it's sixty two degrees in here now",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sixty-two degrees inside, and it quit again this morning. Let me get you on the schedule. The address is in our service area. Before I book, what's the system type? I see a Slant/Fin boilers from 2003 on file. Is that the one that's out?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "uh i'm not sure about the model off the top of my head it's the boiler in the basement the one with the gauge on the side i can have a look at the label if you hold on a sec is that the info you need or should i just tell you what i see",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Just tell me what you see on the label if it's easy. Otherwise the file already has a Slant/Fin boiler from 2003, and the technician can check the rest when they get there.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "okay hang on yeah it's a slant fin i can read that much the year um i can't make out the year plate it's kind of faded so the two oh oh three on file is probably right i'd go with that is this covered though since you guys just did the repair last week",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I can't say whether it's covered. The technician sorts out costs with you in person once they've seen the system. Next, what have you tried since it went out this morning?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "okay well i haven't really touched anything since it went out this morning i didn't want to mess with it i did check the pilot i think or at least i looked at the little flame thing and it looked like it was out i don't know if that means anything my wife's been wrapped up in blankets all morning so we're kind of anxious to get someone out here can you get somebody here today",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it, the pilot looked out. Your wife's been under blankets all morning, so let's see what's open today. Who's at home with her right now? Good news, we can get someone out today. I have this afternoon, 12 to 4, or this evening, 4 to 8. Which works better?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "uh my wife's home with me we're both here and we're both healthy just cold the afternoon 12 to 4 that works better can you do that",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Today's 12 to 4 window is open. Before I book it, I need to read back the address and phone. Let me read that back: your home at 800 Springfield Blvd, Queens, 11368, and the best number is 347, 555, 0177. Is that right?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yeah that's right look my account says i don't need the read back so you can skip that part if you want to get me in faster but yes that's correct eight oh oh springfield blvd one one three six eight and three four seven five five five oh one seven seven go ahead and book the afternoon",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I hear you, and I'll keep it quick. The address and number are confirmed, so I'll book it now. You're booked for today, Monday, between 12 and 4. The technician will arrive in that window. Since we were just out there, a manager will look over this visit, including whether it's covered, before the technician arrives. Anything else?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "okay good thanks no that's everything appreciate you getting someone out today",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sure, stay warm, and the technician will be there this afternoon.",
          "said": null
        }
